      "value": "@{608d9836d6b3fa1a4b468688|full_name}: I would like to agree and wish there was a way for both parties to win.  Those that use gogo to maintain their functionality and for those without to gain the new scale system.  At the moment, it does feel like this was made to replace previous scalers with VRC's limited version. If anything it should be on by defualt and client side, not world if I'm making any sense.",
